  "title": "Easy Apple Rhubarb Crisp",
  "description": "This easy apple rhubarb crisp recipe features a buttery oat streusel with brown sugar and is made even easier by slicing the rhubarb in a food processor.",
  "authors": [
    "Beth"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:56:18-04:00",
